<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has destroyed underground Hezbollah infrastructure in south Lebanon and demolished homes in a southern Lebanese town, while also threatening to seize additional territory in Gaza, Lebanon and Syria. Hezbollah faces legal pressure as Lebanese authorities have charged five members with recruiting and arming others, and US sanctions have targeted a charity linked to Hezbollah and a gold-smuggling network. The World Bank reports that reconstruction in Lebanon is progressing slowly. The UCDP recorded 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOYVJhNkh1T3o0WTcxV1BHX3ltY1RVR0RqT2RlaXFnNmdXUXRsVkFLZTlGZmdPQTk4ZFR6YmloelV2SnZPWjh3czFEMmptSzNYeEFVMFF6cFJqNDhMalpIbzJ0MmJ2MjhnQ19aMXZDdFNMTV9YemNLR1RxXzBFX2ljT2VtRThEblE3Mnc3NzllV2hpTEI1RFV0SmZOeE5oRXVScXA1ZzBxcVpuSzR0T0JybUMtUjgwSXFZZ2VVTTNn?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPTFVnZ2daVU53UVVKdHhQcm9Ma2Uzdkt3ZEtaa2RWcllKNHBhelRoUzhacGtZV19QOUE2NEZfenhqYW1LalpYMVFNcU8wLXVUZDBVdUVoV3I3eUNZRkFmekZlRFJ6THNnbXNBTWVWclc0Z1FUak82aGNtOENXU1M1QzNvZ2xla0loODF4dnlfaG1ZZER0eW5mYnBkdVI0YTNkOVlBUzliWEplcTREdE5Tem13dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Vibes&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE1vUUpKc2RFZl8wTzJpdVpaaWRmQTFfQlFuVnViVGdTQVdZMFhWb0Vfdkk1ZzRSdkFNX1JCOHkzMFhhN1QwTzRqREd3ZlJTUG5MYmUyN3FUWGJVNU9HaFl1TUpB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Global Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Arab&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiA